---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="BookedAgain Support">
  <h1>BookedAgain Support</h1>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Have questions or found a bug? We are here to help.</p>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:rainforest.mind.software@gmail.com">rainforest.mind.software@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Account Deletion</h2>
    <p>There is account deletion button on the account tab. If you encounter issues for account deletion, email us with the subject "Delete Account" from your registered email address.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>Your privacy is important to us. We only collect data necessary to facilitate book swaps.</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy">Read full Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
